# A `for` over an array of blueprints, each row applying its own (Semantics ch. 8: a
# blueprint is a value; ch. 4: a `for` over an array, one row a key, the index).
# Written by Claude on the claude-lowering branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
test mod Tests
use Ui.*

@One: @unit
@One:
    Ui.Label($text=$"one")

@Two: @unit
@Two:
    Ui.Label($text=$"two")

@main: @unit
@main:
    for @each <- [[@One, @Two]]:                                 # 0/[k]
        @each                                                     # 0/[k]/0
